{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53024","headline":"寄姜窈窕诗 · 张叔良","name":"寄姜窈窕诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"几上博山静不焚，匡牀愁卧对斜曛。\n犀梳宝镜人何处？半枕兰香空绿云。\n（《琅嬛记》卷上引《本传》）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张叔良","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53024.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53024","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}